// The typl side of the profile boundary (typl §16.4): TYPL-303 and TYPL-304.
// A `.typl` file is vocabulary only — interaction declarations and the
// expr-core attribute words belong to the profiles above it.
//
// TYPL-302 (a duration literal or timing annotation in a typl context) is
// exercised by the E1 `diag-showcase` entry and is not repeated here.

package diag.ridl

signal currentSpeed : Speed

require currentSpeed >= 0
